Error [jet.ReadOnlyValueNotOwned]: `outer.inner.name` is read in place, so it cannot fill an owned value as-is
  --> main.jet:12:5
    |
 12 |     outer.inner.name ?? ""
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The place keeps its value, so this owning position would copy it, and `copies: .Explicit` is active, so the copy must be written
 Fix: Copy it explicitly with `outer.inner.name.copy()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0120

